{"id":"5dbb49ee42ea9770","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-negation.md","title":"Modal Negation","display":"df-modal-negation — Modal Negation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-negation","aliases":["89-df-modal-negation"],"display":"df-modal-negation — Modal Negation","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-negation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-negation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-negation — Modal Negation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the freely generated modal-formula set from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}negation}\\vdash\n\\neg:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\n\\qquad A\\longmapsto\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}negation}\\vdash\n\\neg:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\n\\qquad A\\longmapsto\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span> 是语法中的原始一元构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond A\">\\(\\Diamond A\\)</span> 才是派生式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box\\neg A\">\\(\\neg\\Box\\neg A\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e77586c4dc7e03a\" href=\"?note=0e77586c4dc7e03a\" title=\"89-df-diamond-modality\">89-df-diamond-modality</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the freely generated modal-formula set from\n[[89-df-modal-formula]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diamond-modality","status":"resolved","id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\neg$ 是语法中的原始一元构造子；$\\Diamond A$ 才是派生式\n$\\neg\\Box\\neg A$（见 [[89-df-diamond-modality]]）。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}negation}\\vdash\n\\neg:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\n\\qquad A\\longmapsto\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond A","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box\\neg A","display":false}],"bytes":691,"backlinks":[{"id":"c6e69f0f07e062bc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-359","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-negation]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","0e77586c4dc7e03a"]}